Interview Experience with Uni Cloud - Cloud Architect Role 🚀

Just completed an insightful interview with Uni Cloud (Noida) for a Cloud Architect role, and I wanted to share some key highlights! 💻

Company Name - Uni Cloud 
Domain - Cloud Architect
Time duration- 40 minutes 

Here are the intriguing questions I tackled:🧑💻

1. How you are setting cloud infrastructure from scratch ? 

2. In-depth knowledge of VPC, subnets, NAT gateway, Internet Gateway, Route table and how it’s work ? 

3. How you are deploying your application on Amazon EKS  (Elastic Kubernetes Service) ? 

4. How you are establishing connection between onpremises services and cloud ? 

5. How you setting DR environment ? 

6. Which monitoring tools you are using in your project ? 

7. Please explain Load balancer and it’s types in detail ? 

8. How you are using auto scaling and load balancer in your project ? 

9. In IAM user how you are giving permission to connect EC2 to ECR ? 

10. What is CDN (Content Delivery Network) and how it’s work ? 

11. What is SSL (Secured Socket Layer) certificate, please explain in detail ? 

12. What is difference between HTTP and HTTPS ?
